This package is a Go port of the Irregular Terrain Model (ITM) v1.3
developed by the Institute for Telecommunication Sciences (ITS) of the
National Telecommunications and Information Administration (NTIA),
https://github.com/NTIA/itm

The original C++ software was developed by employees of NTIA and is not
