worldwide, royalty-free, irrevocable right to use, modify and distribute
the software and derivative works, provided that NTIA is acknowledged.

Modifications (2026-09, Fabian Berg, HB9HIL):
  - Translated from C++ to Go, one Go file per original source file.
  - Area mode (itm_area.cpp, InitializeArea.cpp) not yet ported.
  - Error codes mapped to Go error values; warning flags kept as a bitmask.
  - testdata/p2p.csv and testdata/pfls.csv are the unmodified NTIA test vectors.

